/** @dir Lib/MakeASound/UI
    Plain, reflectable data for device and MIDI settings screens (namespace
    MakeASound), included through MakeASound.h. Nothing here draws: a UI
    toolkit renders it.

    - UIDeviceManager builds the backend, device, sample rate, block size and channel
      dropdowns from a DeviceManager.
    - UIMidiManager builds the MIDI input port toggle list from a MidiManager.
    - Dropdown.h holds DropdownInfo and ToggleListInfo, the data shapes they return.
*/
